{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26215","headline":"帝京二首 一 · 殷尧藩","name":"帝京二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列郡徵才起俊髦，万机独使圣躬劳。\n开藩上相颁龙节，破虏将军展豹韬。\n地入黄图三辅壮，天垂华盖七星高。\n迎春别赐瑶池宴，捧进金盘五色桃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}